item.description:
$$ ax^3+bX^2+cx+d=0 $$<p>根的关系:</p>
$$ x1 + x2 + x3 = (-\frac{b}{a}) $$$$ x1 \times x2 + x1 \times x3 + x2 \times x3 = \frac{c}{a} $$$$ x1 \times x2 \times x3 = (-\frac{d}{a}) $$<p>牛顿迭代解方程(x0附近的根)</p>
<pre><code class="language-cpp">double Newton_Iterative(double a,double b,double c,double d,double x0)
{
 double f0,f0d,x;
 x = x0;
 do
 {
 x0 = x;
 f0 = ((a * x &#43; b) * x &#43; c) * x &#43; d;
 f0d = ( 3 * a * x &#43; 2 * b ) * x &#43; c;
 x = x0 - f0 / f0d;
 }
 while(fabs(f0) &gt;= 1e-12);
 return x;
}</code></pre>
<p>牛顿迭代法</p>
